        {
          "widget": {
            "name": "intro",
            "textbox_spec": "# Campus placements\n\nWhat happened across the recruiting years on record \u2014 who hired, who kept coming back, and what they paid. Every number on this page is produced by SQL over the campus dataset; nothing here is a forecast.\n\n**Placement rate** counts *students* who left the drive with at least one offer. **Offer conversion** counts *processes* that ended in an offer. A student sits several company processes in a year, so the two are different numbers and are never mixed."
          },
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 0,
            "width": 12,
            "height": 4
          }
        },
