          "widget": {
            "name": "method",
            "textbox_spec": "**How to read this page.** *Who keeps coming back* counts the years a company ran a process on campus, out of every year in the dataset \u2014 it describes the past and does not predict the next drive. *Skills placed students held* compares how often a skill appears among students who received an offer against the campus-wide rate; it is a correlation, not a cause, and that panel is empty whenever the placement cell's own records are loaded, because those records carry no skills. Branch figures pool every year and are hidden below five students, so no individual is identifiable from this page."
          },
